{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17249","headline":"早发杭州泛富春江寄陆三十一公佐 · 权德舆","name":"早发杭州泛富春江寄陆三十一公佐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"候晓起徒驭，春江多好风。\n白波连青云，荡漾晨光中。\n四望浩无际，沈忧将此同。\n未离奔走途，但恐成悲翁。\n俯见触饵鳞，仰目淩霄鸿。\n缨尘日已厚，心累何时空。\n区区此人世，所向皆樊笼。\n唯应杯中物，醒醉爲穷通。\n故人悬圃姿，琼树纷青葱。\n终当此山去，共结兰桂丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}